\subsection{Rational Speech Act (RSA)}
The Rational Speech Act (RSA) \cite{arxivID-1510.06807-1} is a framework that models the process of recursive social reasoning between speakers and listeners. It has been widely used in the context of referential games \cite{arxivID-1903.08237-2, arxivID-2202.07023-3, arxivID-2202.07023-4, arxivID-2202.07023-5, arxivID-2202.07023-6, arxivID-2202.07023-7, arxivID-2202.07023-8}
